        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>云南各地美食</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script defer src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\nhtml,\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100%;\n}\n\nbody {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  background: #e8e8e8;\n}\n\n.page {\n  position: relative;\n  width: 540px;\n  height: 719px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  color: #111;\n  background: #59c7ae;\n  font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Noto Sans CJK SC\", \"SimHei\", sans-serif;\n}\n\n.title {\n  position: absolute;\n  z-index: 2;\n  top: 12px;\n  left: 107px;\n  margin: 0;\n  color: #090909;\n  font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", \"Kaiti SC\", serif;\n  font-size: 48px;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  line-height: 61px;\n  letter-spacing: 4px;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n.title-underline-shadow {\n  position: absolute;\n  z-index: 1;\n  top: 70px;\n  left: 92px;\n  width: 354px;\n  height: 15px;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  background: #ffe5a4;\n  transform: rotate(0.5deg);\n}\n\n.title-underline {\n  position: absolute;\n  z-index: 2;\n  top: 72px;\n  left: 97px;\n  width: 342px;\n  height: 8px;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  background: #f05a3e;\n  transform: rotate(0.5deg);\n}\n\n.section {\n  position: absolute;\n  z-index: 3;\n  left: 14px;\n  width: 516px;\n}\n\n.kunming {\n  top: 84px;\n}\n\n.dali {\n  top: 243px;\n}\n\n.lijiang {\n  top: 402px;\n}\n\n.shangri-la {\n  top: 562px;\n}\n\n.section-heading {\n  display: inline-block;\n  height: 26px;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0 4px 1px;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(104, 77, 33, 0.35);\n  background: #fff4cf;\n  box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 rgba(109, 122, 83, 0.32);\n  color: #111;\n  font-family: \"SimHei\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n  font-size: 22px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  line-height: 25px;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n.content {\n  margin-top: 1px;\n  font-size: 17.8px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 20px;\n  letter-spacing: -0.2px;\n}\n\n.line {\n  height: 20px;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n.food {\n  color: #dc2925;\n  font-weight: 900;\n}\n\n.placeholder.decoration {\n  position: absolute;\n  z-index: 0;\n  right: -10px;\n  bottom: -8px;\n  width: 294px;\n  height: 135px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  opacity: 0.22;\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n.vine {\n  position: absolute;\n  right: 1px;\n  bottom: 3px;\n  width: 250px;\n  height: 116px;\n  border-top: 5px solid #f7e8ba;\n  border-radius: 52% 48% 0 0;\n  transform: rotate(-7deg);\n}\n\n.vine::before {\n  content: \"\";\n  position: absolute;\n  right: 54px;\n  top: 20px;\n  width: 150px;\n  height: 82px;\n  border-top: 4px solid #fff6d9;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  transform: rotate(23deg);\n}\n\n.vine::after {\n  content: \"\";\n  position: absolute;\n  right: 12px;\n  top: 35px;\n  width: 104px;\n  height: 65px;\n  border-top: 4px solid #fff6d9;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  transform: rotate(-18deg);\n}\n\n.flower {\n  position: absolute;\n  width: 27px;\n  height: 27px;\n  border: 5px solid #fff5d5;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n}\n\n.flower::before,\n.flower::after {\n  content: \"\";\n  position: absolute;\n  width: 17px;\n  height: 28px;\n  border: 4px solid #fff5d5;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n}\n\n.flower::before {\n  left: -17px;\n  top: -5px;\n  transform: rotate(48deg);\n}\n\n.flower::after {\n  right: -17px;\n  top: -5px;\n  transform: rotate(-48deg);\n}\n\n.flower-one {\n  right: 40px;\n  bottom: 32px;\n  transform: rotate(12deg);\n}\n\n.flower-two {\n  right: 145px;\n  bottom: 8px;\n  transform: scale(0.72) rotate(-18deg);\n}\n\n.leaf {\n  position: absolute;\n  width: 44px;\n  height: 17px;\n  border-radius: 100% 0 100% 0;\n  background: #fff0bd;\n}\n\n.leaf-one {\n  right: 7px;\n  bottom: 11px;\n  transform: rotate(-18deg);\n}\n\n.leaf-two {\n  right: 100px;\n  bottom: 23px;\n  transform: rotate(29deg);\n}\n\n.leaf-three {\n  right: 197px;\n  bottom: 2px;\n  transform: rotate(-31deg);\n}\n\n.sr-only {\n  position: absolute;\n  width: 1px;\n  height: 1px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 540px) {\n  body {\n    display: block;\n    background: #59c7ae;\n  }\n\n  .page {\n    transform-origin: top left;\n  }\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"page\">\n  <h1 class=\"title\">云南各地美食</h1>\n  <div class=\"title-underline-shadow\"></div>\n  <div class=\"title-underline\"></div>\n\n  <section class=\"section kunming\">\n    <h2 class=\"section-heading\">昆明</h2>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"food\">小锅米线：</span>昆明，米线种类众多，当首推小锅米线，还有一种砂</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">锅米线</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"food\">汽锅鸡：</span>这个汤不是真的掺加的水，也就是说这个锅里原来只有鸡</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">肉和作料，一点水不加。那汤是哪里来的呢？水蒸气</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"food\">过桥米线：</span>不能算昆明小吃，应该在蒙自。连最有名的桥香园</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">总店也是在蒙自</div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"section dali\">\n    <h2 class=\"section-heading\">大理</h2>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"food\">饵丝：</span>比煎饼果子好吃！其实没什么可比性。可以加些菜，香肠</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">鸡蛋什么的。酱可以选择咸的或者甜的</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"food\">凉鸡米线：</span>将做好的白斩鸡撕成条，拌入米线里，加入梅子醋和</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">调料，最后浇上一勺卤子水，入口酸甜爽滑</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"food\">乳扇：</span>能煎能炸、能烩能炒、还能卷成筒状内塞馅料。本地常吃</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">的方法是用菜油煎黄后，撒盐或白糖食用</div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"section lijiang\">\n    <h2 class=\"section-heading\">丽江</h2>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"food\">鸡豌豆凉粉：</span>豆经碾磨成粉条，灰绿色，煎炸凉拌都很入味</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"food\">酥油茶：</span>分甜咸两种口味，可以试试</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"food\">鸡豆凉粉：</span>口感爽滑细腻，既可以凉吃也可以热吃，凉粉上加入</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">红辣椒、花椒、青葱酸醋等作料，很是美味</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"food\">丽江粑粑：</span>加入火腿、油、糖等材料制作成的盘子大小“千层</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">饼”似的圆饼</div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"section shangri-la\">\n    <h2 class=\"section-heading\">香格里拉</h2>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"food\">糌粑：</span>它是青稞麦炒熟、磨细、不过筛的炒面</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"food\">迪庆坨坨肉：</span>迪庆彝族的主要煮肉形式。将猪肉或羊、牛肉，不</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">放佐料用冷水煮熟</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"food\">奶渣：</span>奶渣从牛奶中提制而成，用酥油煎奶渣加红糖而成的煎奶</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">渣是藏家人待客常用的一道菜</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"food\">中甸酸奶：</span>用提炼过酥油的奶制作的，适合老人和小孩食用</div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"placeholder decoration\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <span class=\"sr-only\">[Decorative floral motif: bottom-right]</span>\n    <div class=\"vine\"></div>\n    <div class=\"flower flower-one\"></div>\n    <div class=\"flower flower-two\"></div>\n    <div class=\"leaf leaf-one\"></div>\n    <div class=\"leaf leaf-two\"></div>\n    <div class=\"leaf leaf-three\"></div>\n  </div>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>"
